  "reference": "Original Multimodal Training high-fidelity visual standard",
  "hero": "<section class=\"g2-hero\"><span class=\"g2-kicker\">PREDICTION TIME · DATA BOUNDARIES</span><h2>A model cannot learn from tomorrow.</h2><p>See how unavailable future facts and held-out test records can sneak into fitting and produce misleading evaluation scores.</p><div class=\"g2-canvas\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 940 345\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Training model with current input data and a red dashed future outcome path leaking backward into training\"><rect x=\"1\" y=\"1\" width=\"938\" height=\"343\" rx=\"17\" fill=\"#fcfeff\" stroke=\"#d6e7eb\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"31\" y=\"45\" width=\"247\" height=\"216\" rx=\"23\" fill=\"#eaf5fc\" stroke=\"#c6dfeb\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"57\" y=\"84\" fill=\"#4c83bb\" font-size=\"20\" font-weight=\"850\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\">AVAILABLE NOW</text><rect x=\"62\" y=\"113\" width=\"82\" height=\"78\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#bad7e6\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"103\" y=\"158\" fill=\"#4c83bb\" font-size=\"35\" font-weight=\"900\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\">x</text><rect x=\"160\" y=\"113\" width=\"82\" height=\"78\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#e4f5ed\" stroke=\"#bad7e6\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"201\" y=\"158\" fill=\"#138477\" font-size=\"35\" font-weight=\"900\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\">y</text><text x=\"67\" y=\"230\" fill=\"#1f4054\" font-size=\"20\" font-weight=\"850\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\">Training inputs</text><rect x=\"355\" y=\"51\" width=\"223\" height=\"201\" rx=\"28\" fill=\"#e4f5ed\" stroke=\"#a5dac9\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"465\" y=\"93\" fill=\"#138477\" font-size=\"23\" font-weight=\"900\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\">MODEL</text><path d=\"M414 151Q448 115 499 144Q551 181 514 204Q467 231 419 196Z\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#138477\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><text x=\"467\" y=\"181\" fill=\"#1f4054\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"900\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\">FIT</text><rect x=\"647\" y=\"48\" width=\"254\" height=\"91\" rx=\"18\" fill=\"#fff2db\" stroke=\"#efdbb6\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"672\" y=\"86\" fill=\"#94682a\" font-size=\"20\" font-weight=\"850\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\">FUTURE OUTCOME</text><text x=\"672\" y=\"112\" fill=\"#567080\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\">Unavailable right now</text><rect x=\"647\" y=\"183\" width=\"254\" height=\"84\" rx=\"18\" fill=\"#ffebe9\" stroke=\"#efbfbb\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"675\" y=\"218\" fill=\"#cc6963\" font-size=\"20\" font-weight=\"850\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\">SCORE MIRAGE</text><text x=\"675\" y=\"247\" fill=\"#567080\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\">Unreliable high score</text><path d=\"M281 164L351 164\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#138477\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><path d=\"M340.4690092573155 169.75310646325045L351 164L340.4690092573155 158.24689353674955\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#138477\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><path d=\"M583 167L641 167\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#4c83bb\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><path d=\"M630.4690092573155 172.75310646325045L641 167L630.4690092573155 161.24689353674955\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#4c83bb\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><path d=\"M779 147V169Q744 212 576 222\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#cc6963\" stroke-width=\"5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-dasharray=\"9 9\"/><rect x=\"311\" y=\"282\" width=\"350\" height=\"34\" rx=\"17\" fill=\"#ffebe9\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"486\" y=\"305\" fill=\"#cc6963\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"800\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\">Stop future data crossing backward</text></svg></div><div class=\"g2-mini\"><span>Feature availability</span><span>Training-only statistics</span><span>Independent evaluation</span></div></section>",
