      "html": "<section class=\"g2-figure\" data-scene=\"dl-pipeline-boundary\"><span class=\"g2-kicker\">VISUAL 05 · DATA LEAKAGE</span><h3>The Pipeline lives inside cross-validation</h3><div class=\"g2-canvas\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 940 370\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Imputation, scaling, selection, and estimator fit inside each training fold, followed by validation-only scoring\"><rect x=\"1\" y=\"1\" width=\"938\" height=\"368\" rx=\"17\" fill=\"#fcfeff\" stroke=\"#d6e7eb\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"42\" y=\"43\" fill=\"#138477\" font-size=\"19\" font-weight=\"900\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\">REFIT ALL STEPS INSIDE EACH TRAINING FOLD</text><rect x=\"37\" y=\"71\" width=\"670\" height=\"233\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"#e4f5ed\" stroke=\"#acd8c9\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"64\" y=\"125\" width=\"137\" height=\"111\" rx=\"15\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#b6d8d1\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"132\" y=\"168\" fill=\"#1f4054\" font-size=\"22\" font-weight=\"850\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\">Impute</text><text x=\"132\" y=\"200\" fill=\"#138477\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\">fit / transform</text><path d=\"M203 178L223 178\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#138477\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><path d=\"M212.46900925731552 183.75310646325045L223 178L212.46900925731552 172.24689353674955\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#138477\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><rect x=\"224\" y=\"125\" width=\"137\" height=\"111\" rx=\"15\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#b6d8d1\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"292\" y=\"168\" fill=\"#1f4054\" font-size=\"22\" font-weight=\"850\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\">Scale</text><text x=\"292\" y=\"200\" fill=\"#138477\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\">fit / transform</text><path d=\"M363 178L383 178\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#138477\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><path d=\"M372.4690092573155 183.75310646325045L383 178L372.4690092573155 172.24689353674955\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#138477\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><rect x=\"384\" y=\"125\" width=\"137\" height=\"111\" rx=\"15\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#b6d8d1\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"452\" y=\"168\" fill=\"#1f4054\" font-size=\"22\" font-weight=\"850\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\">Select</text><text x=\"452\" y=\"200\" fill=\"#138477\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\">fit / transform</text><path d=\"M523 178L543 178\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#138477\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><path d=\"M532.4690092573155 183.75310646325045L543 178L532.4690092573155 172.24689353674955\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#138477\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><rect x=\"544\" y=\"125\" width=\"137\" height=\"111\" rx=\"15\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#b6d8d1\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"612\" y=\"168\" fill=\"#1f4054\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"850\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\">Train model</text><text x=\"612\" y=\"200\" fill=\"#138477\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\">fit</text><rect x=\"733\" y=\"71\" width=\"172\" height=\"233\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"#eaf5fc\" stroke=\"#bed9e8\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"819\" y=\"155\" fill=\"#4c83bb\" font-size=\"20\" font-weight=\"850\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\">VALIDATE</text><text x=\"819\" y=\"191\" fill=\"#567080\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"650\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\">transform</text><text x=\"819\" y=\"215\" fill=\"#567080\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"650\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\">and score</text><path d=\"M708 178L730 178\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#4c83bb\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><path d=\"M719.4690092573155 183.75310646325045L730 178L719.4690092573155 172.24689353674955\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#4c83bb\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><rect x=\"165\" y=\"317\" width=\"620\" height=\"34\" rx=\"17\" fill=\"#fff2db\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"475\" y=\"340\" fill=\"#956923\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"800\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\">cross_val_score refits each full Pipeline per fold</text></svg></div><p class=\"g2-note\">A Pipeline prevents leakage only when preprocessing and selection happen inside it.</p></section>"
