-size=\"21\" font-weight=\"900\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\">× Not available yet</text><rect x=\"299\" y=\"308\" width=\"345\" height=\"34\" rx=\"17\" fill=\"#eaf5fc\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"471.5\" y=\"331\" fill=\"#4c83bb\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"800\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\">Trace: feature → source → timestamp</text><circle cx=\"238\" cy=\"251\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#138477\"/><circle cx=\"754\" cy=\"251\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#cc6963\"/><path d=\"M438 210H493\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#cc6963\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"5 5\"/></svg></div><p class=\"g2-note\">Data lineage supplies the feature source and timestamp so feature availability can be checked.</p></section>"
